  m_text: "Once everything is set up, a new \"Archipelago\" button should appear
    at the bottom of your screen.\n\nEnter archipelago.gg in the \"ADDRESS\" field,
    then enter the room\u2019s 5-digit port number in \"PORT\". You can find this
    number on the website after creating a new room.\n\nThe \"PASSWORD\" field is
    optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nIn \"PLAYER SLOT\",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nFinally, click \"CONNECT\" and
    then, you can start a new run!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
